      "type": "intro",
      "heading": "Questions you can answer today",
      "body": "You already know haan (yes) and nahin (no). Now let's build the questions that produce those answers.\n\nPunjabi yes/no questions work differently from English — no word swaps, no \"do you\". One small word does all the work."
